1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:05,030
An insertion can fail because the operator cannot see the gap clearly.
插入可能失败，只因操作者看不清间隙。

2
00:00:05,390 --> 00:00:09,810
Open-TeleVision lets the robot's stereo camera follow the operator's head movement.
Open-TeleVision让机器人双目相机跟随人转头。

3
00:00:10,110 --> 00:00:14,850
The central innovation is active visual feedback inside an immersive teleoperation loop.
核心创新是沉浸遥操作中的主动视觉反馈。

4
00:00:15,338 --> 00:00:19,458
The headset sends hand, wrist, and head poses toward the robot.
头显向机器人发送手、腕和头部姿态。

5
00:00:19,818 --> 00:00:24,458
Retargeting and inverse kinematics convert those poses into feasible joint commands.
重定向与逆运动学将姿态转成可行关节指令。

6
00:00:25,058 --> 00:00:29,098
Stereo video travels back, allowing the person to adjust the next action.
双目视频回传，让人调整下一步动作。

7
00:00:29,611 --> 00:00:35,431
The experiments use an H1 platform with six-degree-of-freedom hands and a GR-1 platform.
实验包括配6自由度手的H1，以及GR-1。

8
00:00:35,951 --> 00:00:40,171
The latter uses simple grippers, so their dexterity should not be conflated.
后者使用简单夹爪，不能混同两者的灵巧性。

9
00:00:40,611 --> 00:00:45,011
Moving the camera helps visibility, but does not directly measure contact force.
移动相机改善可见性，却不能直接测接触力。

10
00:00:45,602 --> 00:00:52,482
Robot observations and commands recorded during teleoperation train an autonomous action-chunking policy.
遥操记录的观测和指令训练自主动作分块策略。

11
00:00:52,942 --> 00:00:57,042
Stereo image features and robot state condition the future action sequence.
双目图像特征和机器人状态作为动作序列条件。

12
00:00:57,462 --> 00:01:01,426
At this stage, the operator is removed from the autonomous execution loop.
在这一阶段，操作者退出自主执行闭环。

13
00:01:01,876 --> 00:01:07,776
Sorting uses ten long demonstrations per platform; the other tasks use twenty each.
分类每平台十条长示教，其余任务各二十条。

14
00:01:08,196 --> 00:01:13,096
Each task is evaluated across five complete episodes containing repeated operations.
每任务评测五个完整回合，回合含重复操作。

15
00:01:13,596 --> 00:01:17,796
An individual pick or placement is not automatically a successful full episode.
单次捡起或放置成功，不等于整个回合成功。

16
00:01:18,335 --> 00:01:23,875
H1 sorting reports ninety-two percent picking and eighty-eight percent placement success.
H1分类中，捡起92%，放置88%。

17
00:01:24,615 --> 00:01:28,615
GR-1 placement is sixty percent, despite its higher picking score.
GR-1放置为60%，低于它的捡起分数。

18
00:01:29,135 --> 00:01:33,455
These are reported stage outcomes, not a universal whole-task success rate.
这些是阶段结果，不是通用整任务成功率。

19
00:01:33,923 --> 00:01:37,963
A gripper can hide an object's color after a successful grasp.
夹爪可能在抓取成功后遮住物体颜色。

20
00:01:38,483 --> 00:01:42,463
Short policy memory then makes the correct sorting decision harder to preserve.
策略记忆较短，会难以保留正确分类依据。

21
00:01:42,843 --> 00:01:46,943
The paper does not establish millimeter accuracy for the headset's hand tracker.
论文也没有验证头显手部跟踪的毫米级精度。

22
00:01:47,508 --> 00:01:53,167
The lesson is that observation quality shapes both human control and recorded demonstrations.
观察质量同时影响人工控制和示教记录。

23
00:01:53,967 --> 00:01:57,727
Better viewing geometry can make a difficult contact easier to teach.
更好的观察几何能让困难接触更容易教。

24
00:01:58,527 --> 00:02:03,148
Precision still depends on the robot, policy, calibration, and task-specific feedback.
精细表现仍取决于机器人、策略、标定与反馈。
